---
source: apps/via/tests/help_surface.rs
expression: "long_help(&[\"chat\"])"
---
Text client: drive a running Gateway with no audio and no model weights

Usage: via chat [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --url <URL>
          Gateway address (http or https; normalised to its origin)
          
          [env: VIA_URL]
          [default: http://127.0.0.1:3101]

      --session <ID>
          Voice session to join (default: a fresh voice-<32 hex> id)
          
          [env: VIA_SESSION_ID]

      --takeover
          Take voice control from whichever client currently holds it

      --no-autostart
          Refuse rather than start a Gateway when none is running

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
